cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Wafer Map TDA: Persistent-Homology Features and Mapper Graphs for Wafer Defect Patterns"
abstract: >-
  Notebooks that generate synthetic WM811K-style wafer maps, extract
  persistent-homology (TDA) features, classify defect types with a random
  forest, and build KeplerMapper graphs of the feature space.
authors:
